---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import missionImage from '../assets/img/IMG_20260313_155320.jpg';
---

<section id="mission" class="mission">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div class="mission-visual reveal">
        <div class="image-wrapper">
          <Image src={missionImage} alt="Paysage forestier Héraultais" width="500" format="png" quality={80} />
        </div>
        <div class="stats-mini reveal">
          <div class="stat-item">
            <span class="value">310</span>
            <span class="label">Hectares</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <span class="value">31</span>
            <span class="label">Propriétaires</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mission-text">
        <span class="subtitle reveal">Qui sommes-nous ?</span>
        <h2 class="reveal">
          Une initiative collective pour la <span>forêt</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="text-content reveal">
          <p class="lead">
            L’Association Syndicale Libre des châtaigneraies du Pays
            Saint-Ponais a été créé en 2023 afin de rassembler les propriétaires
            forestiers du territoire autour d’un projet de valorisation des
            massifs forestiers environnants.
          </p>
          <p>
            31 propriétaires ont adhéré au projet pour sa première phase,
            regroupant ainsi 310 hectares de forêts sur les communes de <strong
              >Courniou</strong
            >, <strong>Saint-Pons-de-Thomières</strong>, et <strong
              >Riols</strong
            >, dans l’Hérault.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="features-grid reveal">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon">🌿</div>
            <h3>Valorisation</h3>
            <p>Permettre une valorisation de la ressource en bois via une sylviculture douce.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>Engagement</h3>
            <p>Rassembler les acteurs locaux autour d’une filière bois respectueuses des humains et de la forêt.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mission {
    padding: 12rem 0;
    background: var(--bg-light);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .mission::before {
    content: 'ASLGF';
    position: absolute;
    top: 5rem;
    right: -2rem;
    font-size: 15rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: rgba(26, 47, 35, 0.02);
    z-index: 0;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .mission-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 8rem;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .mission-visual {
    position: relative;
  }

  .image-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 40px 80px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
  }

  .image-wrapper img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.8s var(--transition);
  }

  .mission:hover .image-wrapper img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .stats-mini {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -3rem;
    right: -3rem;
    background: var(--primary);
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    color: white;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .stat-item .value {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .stat-item .label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    opacity: 0.7;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .subtitle {
    display: block;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  h2 span {
    color: var(--secondary);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .text-content p {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #4a5568;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .text-content .lead {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: white;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid #edf2f7;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .feature-card .icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #718096;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .mission-grid {
      gap: 4rem;
    }
    .stats-mini {
      position: relative;
      bottom: 0;
      right: 0;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      border-radius: 1.5rem;
      padding: 2rem;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 968px) {
    .mission-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .mission {
      padding: 6rem 0;
    }
    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .stats-mini {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .stat-item .value {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
    .text-content .lead {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .text-content p {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
